{
  "name": "Sandstorm",
  "type": "feature",
  "img": "icons/magic/air/air-burst-spiral-yellow.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p><em>Countdown (6).</em> When the <span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Pharaoh</span> is in the spotlight for the first time, activate the countdown. It ticks down when a PC rolls with Fear or the <span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Pharaoh</span> takes damage. When it triggers, an abrasive sandstorm fills the air within a Very Far range of the <span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Pharaoh</span>, which lasts until they are defeated. Attacks made against the <span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Pharaoh</span>'s allies inside the sandstorm have disadvantage. PCs in the sandstorm take <strong>12</strong> physical damage when they make an action roll.</p>",
